{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22129","headline":"清夜琴兴 · 白居易","name":"清夜琴兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月出鸟栖尽，寂然坐空林。\n是时心境闲，可以弹素琴。\n清泠由木性，恬澹随人心。\n心积和平气，木应正始音。\n响余羣动息，曲罢秋夜深。\n正声感元化，天地清沈沈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22129.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22129","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}